{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;A Nice Game About Balls&quot;, you\u2019ll use your <strong>wits</strong>, your <strong>cunning</strong>, and some <strong>expertly timed buffs</strong> to roll your balls to sweet, sweet victory.<br><br>Plot your <strong>trajectory</strong>, avoid the <strong>obstacles</strong>, set up <strong>traps</strong>, and knock your <strong>opponents</strong> out of contention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/896798d842fab4c018abab3f20ba09ab.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"hazards\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/896798d842fab4c018abab3f20ba09ab.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/896798d842fab4c018abab3f20ba09ab.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn yourself points, new <strong>buffs</strong>, and the respect of your <strong>opponents</strong> as you forge your way through this <strong>skill-based</strong>, kinda-<strong>tactical</strong>, kinda-<strong>deckbuilding</strong>, <strong>roguelite</strong>-ish, <strong>physics</strong>-based, <strong>spherical</strong> adventure.<br><br>Balls... hopes to provide some chill, skill-based satisfaction, some highs, some lows, and some weirdness thrown in for good measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: this game is a work in progress, and features may change a bit. \ud83d\udc4d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/0b2d107f0eefb8bfff39d40f2b4846f4.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Roll-like adventure!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e152b86cab033fa9d856436cb9a95fd1.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"stunt cam\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e152b86cab033fa9d856436cb9a95fd1.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e152b86cab033fa9d856436cb9a95fd1.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a campaign, choose your route, earn points, <strong>collect cards</strong>, and deploy game-winning buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a head-to-head match, they get 3 balls, and you get 3 balls. May the best ball slinger win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/9121cbb39cc22ea1f76ce3f91ebb498b.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Boss fights!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/830552c27b5d869a3cb4cc088f72cd0c.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"boss fights\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/830552c27b5d869a3cb4cc088f72cd0c.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/830552c27b5d869a3cb4cc088f72cd0c.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way past the underlings and take on the area <strong>bosses</strong>! They don\u2019t always play fair, but remember that the bosses can be a bit touchy and winning means a lot to them, so be nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/753076eeccec2352a5e8e2e8dbd97cbf.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Deck building!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b27fa178baa5ab450f84d7e0a25aa05a.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"deckbuilding\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b27fa178baa5ab450f84d7e0a25aa05a.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b27fa178baa5ab450f84d7e0a25aa05a.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some opponents are just naturally <strong><i>better</i></strong><i> </i>than you, and that sucks. To even things out, you can collect <strong>buff cards</strong> and deploy them at the perfect time to give yourself the advantage - wiping that smug, self-satisfied look from your foe\u2019s face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b90b17f8453c28d325c33de82e085fde.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Trick shots!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/7baa254b9d0550460575e1cc1d546199.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"ball roll history\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/7baa254b9d0550460575e1cc1d546199.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/7baa254b9d0550460575e1cc1d546199.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting your way through a full competitive campaign can be <strong>challenging</strong>, so instead, you can unlock chilled skill levels. No opponents, no limitations, just keep rolling the balls until you make an awesome shot you can upload to the internet and you become a huge celebrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/d809b7e7c093980167a7781830f39b5f.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Human vs. human!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/86f8b9eb7c8065977960b3bca99a0cd7.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"player vs player\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/86f8b9eb7c8065977960b3bca99a0cd7.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/86f8b9eb7c8065977960b3bca99a0cd7.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each level unlocked, \u2018<strong>A Nice Game About Balls</strong>\u2019 allows you to replay it locally against a <strong>friend</strong>, <strong>family member</strong>, or a <strong>pet</strong>, maybe. Just roll some balls and do your best. We\u2019re all friends here.<br><br>Oh, but it\u2019s unlikely to be an online mode because there\u2019s no way in hell I can afford that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/3eb82c2f543b8582baaacc510be0eb3a.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"You vs you!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each game played, your score will be recorded, and a judgment will be provided. Why settle for an <strong>F</strong> grade when you can play again and get a C? Works for me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/8c77b10629e6e9e13dce855b1f86e331.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"And more?\" width=426 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/351eb5f79868fb958b8b85d2bbb09d12.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"ball spin\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/351eb5f79868fb958b8b85d2bbb09d12.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/351eb5f79868fb958b8b85d2bbb09d12.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, I haven\u2019t completely figured everything out yet, so I may have better ideas at some point. Who can say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>NOTE</strong>: Development is in the early stages, so the screenshots and videos here are a work-in-progress - expect things to change! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079120?t=1774459594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/93ba7fc62809d97da53c3b3d2ed16760327a63b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774459594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/e4476ba8d7af8ed7f80f5e36fade3479d4fba054/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774459594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/e4476ba8d7af8ed7f80f5e36fade3479d4fba054/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774459594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;A Nice Game About Balls&quot;, you\u2019ll use your <strong>wits</strong>, your <strong>cunning</strong>, and some <strong>expertly timed buffs</strong> to roll your balls to sweet, sweet victory.<br><br>Plot your <strong>trajectory</strong>, avoid the <strong>obstacles</strong>, set up <strong>traps</strong>, and knock your <strong>opponents</strong> out of contention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/896798d842fab4c018abab3f20ba09ab.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"hazards\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/896798d842fab4c018abab3f20ba09ab.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/896798d842fab4c018abab3f20ba09ab.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn yourself points, new <strong>buffs</strong>, and the respect of your <strong>opponents</strong> as you forge your way through this <strong>skill-based</strong>, kinda-<strong>tactical</strong>, kinda-<strong>deckbuilding</strong>, <strong>roguelite</strong>-ish, <strong>physics</strong>-based, <strong>spherical</strong> adventure.<br><br>Balls... hopes to provide some chill, skill-based satisfaction, some highs, some lows, and some weirdness thrown in for good measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: this game is a work in progress, and features may change a bit. \ud83d\udc4d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/0b2d107f0eefb8bfff39d40f2b4846f4.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Roll-like adventure!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e152b86cab033fa9d856436cb9a95fd1.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"stunt cam\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e152b86cab033fa9d856436cb9a95fd1.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e152b86cab033fa9d856436cb9a95fd1.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a campaign, choose your route, earn points, <strong>collect cards</strong>, and deploy game-winning buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a head-to-head match, they get 3 balls, and you get 3 balls. May the best ball slinger win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/9121cbb39cc22ea1f76ce3f91ebb498b.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Boss fights!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/830552c27b5d869a3cb4cc088f72cd0c.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"boss fights\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/830552c27b5d869a3cb4cc088f72cd0c.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/830552c27b5d869a3cb4cc088f72cd0c.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way past the underlings and take on the area <strong>bosses</strong>! They don\u2019t always play fair, but remember that the bosses can be a bit touchy and winning means a lot to them, so be nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/753076eeccec2352a5e8e2e8dbd97cbf.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Deck building!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b27fa178baa5ab450f84d7e0a25aa05a.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"deckbuilding\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b27fa178baa5ab450f84d7e0a25aa05a.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b27fa178baa5ab450f84d7e0a25aa05a.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some opponents are just naturally <strong><i>better</i></strong><i> </i>than you, and that sucks. To even things out, you can collect <strong>buff cards</strong> and deploy them at the perfect time to give yourself the advantage - wiping that smug, self-satisfied look from your foe\u2019s face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b90b17f8453c28d325c33de82e085fde.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Trick shots!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/7baa254b9d0550460575e1cc1d546199.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"ball roll history\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/7baa254b9d0550460575e1cc1d546199.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/7baa254b9d0550460575e1cc1d546199.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting your way through a full competitive campaign can be <strong>challenging</strong>, so instead, you can unlock chilled skill levels. No opponents, no limitations, just keep rolling the balls until you make an awesome shot you can upload to the internet and you become a huge celebrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/d809b7e7c093980167a7781830f39b5f.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"Human vs. human!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/86f8b9eb7c8065977960b3bca99a0cd7.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"player vs player\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/86f8b9eb7c8065977960b3bca99a0cd7.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/86f8b9eb7c8065977960b3bca99a0cd7.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each level unlocked, \u2018<strong>A Nice Game About Balls</strong>\u2019 allows you to replay it locally against a <strong>friend</strong>, <strong>family member</strong>, or a <strong>pet</strong>, maybe. Just roll some balls and do your best. We\u2019re all friends here.<br><br>Oh, but it\u2019s unlikely to be an online mode because there\u2019s no way in hell I can afford that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/3eb82c2f543b8582baaacc510be0eb3a.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"You vs you!\" width=426 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each game played, your score will be recorded, and a judgment will be provided. Why settle for an <strong>F</strong> grade when you can play again and get a C? Works for me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/8c77b10629e6e9e13dce855b1f86e331.webp?t=1774459594\" alt=\"And more?\" width=426 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/351eb5f79868fb958b8b85d2bbb09d12.poster.avif?t=1774459594\" aria-label=\"ball spin\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/351eb5f79868fb958b8b85d2bbb09d12.webm?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/351eb5f79868fb958b8b85d2bbb09d12.mp4?t=1774459594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest, I haven\u2019t completely figured everything out yet, so I may have better ideas at some point. Who can say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>NOTE</strong>: Development is in the early stages, so the screenshots and videos here are a work-in-progress - expect things to change! </p>","developers":["Thumb Flame Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/0119074d483f7fef267e80f4f04ce868b58611d4/header.jpg?t=1774459594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13<br></li><li><